# Web3Forms – free form-to-email service (https://web3forms.com)
# 1. Visit https://web3forms.com and enter dreamlifeinidaho@gmail.com
# 2. Check your inbox for the access key
# 3. Paste it below and rename this file to .env.local
# 4. If deploying to Vercel, add this variable in Settings → Environment Variables
#    then redeploy — NEXT_PUBLIC_ vars are embedded at build time
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your_access_key_here
